    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849750/extras/eae9f213962a72a12c8d3a7d74bd1a17.poster.avif?t=1729962870\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849750/extras/eae9f213962a72a12c8d3a7d74bd1a17.webm?t=1729962870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849750/extras/eae9f213962a72a12c8d3a7d74bd1a17.mp4?t=1729962870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In KILLDOZER SIMULATOR, operate an armored bulldozer in a top-down action-packed struggle to flatten the town and clash with The Powers That Be. Upgrade your vehicle, plan your path of destruction, and become a legendary folk hero.<br><br>Destructible Environments: Leave your mark on the world with fully destructible environments.<br><br>Intense Top-Down Combat: Experience the thrill of battling against government authorities in high-stakes combat. Utilize strategy and firepower to outsmart your opponents and survive against the odds.<br><br>Vehicle Customization and Upgrades: Transform your killdozer into an unstoppable force with a variety of upgrades and customizations. Strengthen your defenses, enhance your weaponry, and adapt your vehicle to overcome new challenges as the game progresses.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849750/extras/eae9f213962a72a12c8d3a7d74bd1a17.poster.avif?t=1729962870\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849750/extras/eae9f213962a72a12c8d3a7d74bd1a17.webm?t=1729962870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849750/extras/eae9f213962a72a12c8d3a7d74bd1a17.mp4?t=1729962870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In KILLDOZER SIMULATOR, operate an armored bulldozer in a top-down action-packed struggle to flatten the town and clash with The Powers That Be. Upgrade your vehicle, plan your path of destruction, and become a legendary folk hero.<br><br>Destructible Environments: Leave your mark on the world with fully destructible environments.<br><br>Intense Top-Down Combat: Experience the thrill of battling against government authorities in high-stakes combat. Utilize strategy and firepower to outsmart your opponents and survive against the odds.<br><br>Vehicle Customization and Upgrades: Transform your killdozer into an unstoppable force with a variety of upgrades and customizations. Strengthen your defenses, enhance your weaponry, and adapt your vehicle to overcome new challenges as the game progresses.",
